flowchart TD
    S1[1 User logs in or registers] --> S2[2 Frontend calls auth API]
    S2 --> S3[3 Backend validates user and returns JWT]

    S3 --> S4[4 User uploads document]
    S4 --> S5[5 Backend runs document OCR and face extraction]
    S5 --> S6[6 Document stage result stored]

    S6 --> S7[7 User uploads live selfie]
    S7 --> S8[8 Backend runs face match inference]
    S8 --> S9[9 Face score stored]

    S9 --> S10[10 Backend runs deepfake inference]
    S10 --> S11[11 Deepfake score stored]

    S11 --> S12[12 Backend runs liveness inference]
    S12 --> S13[13 Liveness score stored]

    S13 --> S14[14 Final decision and report generation]
    S14 --> S15[15 Report ID and download URL returned]
    S15 --> S16[16 User downloads PDF report]
